  "_note": "The kinds of health payment that fill a bucket's insurance limb: a premium and a notified health scheme's contribution (s.126(2)(a), (b); 1961 s.80D(2)(a), (b)), as the bucket rows' notes quote them; the parents' bucket takes no scheme (D-145, its own row's conditions). A preventive check-up fills it too, after DED-HEALTH-CHECKUP's limit, and a medical payment fills DED-HEALTH-MEDICAL-LIMB's. Conditions only, on health.kind; provenance and introduction are DED-HEALTH-FAMILY's (W-156b2, D-347). Old regime only, as the health rows.",
